      "writtenOn": "2015-06-29T19:36:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of adding a variable to the pd var struct, I will add a bit to the flags variable as suggested. The main reason I had to #ifdef so many places was so that I wasn\u0027t adding anymore memory resources (or code) to  boards that didn\u0027t need this option. \n\nI will only use the new config option (shortened as suggested) for the code that enables/disables the feature.\n\nLooking at the mask you suggest, it\u0027s only being used when source_disconnected is the next state. Do you know why it\u0027s only being cleared there?",
      "parentUuid": "934c958c_edef3dfc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 122,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 122,
