      "writtenOn": "2015-06-29T21:06:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "are you referring to PD_FLAGS_RESET_ON_DISCONNECT_MASK? That mask is used when you go to either SNK_ or SRC_ DISCONNECTED. it\u0027s not obvious though, you have to work your way through a bunch of preprocessor checks in order to see that.",
